homelab-web-proxy (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release. nginx reverse-proxy + certbot TLS for the
    homelab-api web family (Roundcube/API/Drive/SSO), one package-owned
    vhost file per service in sites-available, never touching any other
    site already on a shared host. Certbot only invoked if a cert
    doesn't already exist for that domain.

 -- Gardner <gardner@homelab>  Sun, 23 Aug 2026 06:00:00 -0500
